&gt; Exciting news from Pour Demain! Pour Demain Europe is hiring for two new roles, both working on frontier AI policy in the EU (AI Act implementation, the GPAI Code of Practice, and the AI Office).
&gt; 
&gt; :compass: <https://eu.jotform.com/form/262166120063143|Managing Director >— to lead the organisation as it grows from 5 to 10+ staff. Open to two profiles: a senior AI leader, or a strong organisational leader with some grounding in AI safety.
&gt; 
&gt; :microscope: <https://eu.jotform.com/form/262167068943162|(Senior) Advisor, AI Safety> — either a policy track (Brussels-based, engaging directly with EU institutions) or a research track (remote-friendly, frequent trips to Brussels).
&gt; 
&gt; :hourglass_flowing_sand: Initial deadline 17 August, final deadline 31 August. Applications are reviewed as they come in, so earlier is better.
&gt; 
&gt; Both forms take 5–10 minutes; no cover letter. Worth passing on to anyone who might be a fit! :pray:
